 cdbdisp.c:00003746:  * the caller's error catcher via ereport(ERROR,...). Otherwise this 
 cdbdisp.c:00003747:  * function returns normally and errors are not reported until later. 
 cdbdisp.c:00003748:  * 
 cdbdisp.c:00003749:  * If cancelOnError is false, the plan is to be dispatched as fully as 
 cdbdisp.c:00003750:  * possible and the QEs allowed to proceed regardless of cancellation 
 cdbdisp.c:00003751:  * requests, errors or connection failures from other QEs, etc. 
 cdbdisp.c:00003752:  * 
 cdbdisp.c:00003753:  * The CdbDispatchResults objects allocated for the plan are returned in 
 cdbdisp.c:00003754:  * *pPrimaryResults and (if needed) *pMirrorResults. The caller, after 
 cdbdisp.c:00003755:  * calling CdbCheckDispatchResult(), can examine the CdbDispatchResults 
 cdbdisp.c:00003756:  * objects, can keep them as long as needed, and ultimately must free them 
 cdbdisp.c:00003757:  * with cdbdisp_destroyDispatchResults() prior to deallocation of the 
 cdbdisp.c:00003758:  * caller's memory context. Callers should use PG_TRY/PG_CATCH to 
 cdbdisp.c:00003759:  * ensure proper cleanup. 
 cdbdisp.c:00003760:  * 
 cdbdisp.c:00003761:  * To wait for completion, check for errors, and clean up, it is 
 cdbdisp.c:00003762:  * suggested that the caller use cdbdisp_finishCommand(). 
 cdbdisp.c:00003763:  * 
 cdbdisp.c:00003764:  * Note that the slice tree dispatched is the one specified in the EState 
 cdbdisp.c:00003765:  * of the argument QueryDesc as es_cur__slice. 
 cdbdisp.c:00003766:  * 
 cdbdisp.c:00003767:  * Note that the QueryDesc params must include PARAM_EXEC_REMOTE parameters 
 cdbdisp.c:00003768:  * containing the values of any initplans required by the slice to be run. 
 cdbdisp.c:00003769:  * (This is handled by calls to addRemoteExecParamsToParamList() from the 
 cdbdisp.c:00003770:  * functions preprocess_initplans() and ExecutorRun().) 
 cdbdisp.c:00003771:  * 
 cdbdisp.c:00003772:  * Each QE receives its assignment as a message of type 'M' in PostgresMain(). 
 cdbdisp.c:00003773:  * The message is deserialized and processed by exec_mpp_query() in postgres.c. 
 cdbdisp.c:00003774:  */ 
