 sysv_sema.c:00000136:  "respective kernel parameter. Alternatively, reduce PostgreSQL's " 
 sysv_sema.c:00000137:  "consumption of semaphores by reducing its max_connections parameter " 
 sysv_sema.c:00000138:  "(currently %d).
 " 
 sysv_sema.c:00000139:  "The PostgreSQL documentation contains more information about " 
 sysv_sema.c:00000140:  "configuring your system for PostgreSQL.", 
